title: 'pallet-preimage: preserve the deposit when release fails'
doc:
- audience: [Runtime Dev, Runtime User]
  description: |
    An unnote operation that cannot release a preimage deposit now preserves the deposit
    record and preimage so it can be retried. The dispatchable returns the release error.
    The StorePreimage trait method rolls back on failure, then triggers a debug assertion
    in debug builds or logs the error in release builds.
crates:
- name: pallet-preimage
  bump: patch
